ி","gloss":"twisted"},{"text":"சடை","lemma":"சடை","gloss":"matted hair"}],"gloss":"twisted matted hair"},{"surface":"புலர்த்துவோனே","parts":[{"text":"புலர்த்துவோன்","lemma":"புலர்த்து","gloss":"he who dries"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he who dries!"}]}],"literal":"Like a painting spacious mansion-in / doll like small-braceleted women / jewels' position loosened to-the-warrior approaching / bamboo-joint tall mountain waterfall-having-bathed / forest elephant brought firewood-with / intense heat red fire having-kindled / back-hanging twisted matted-hair drying-he-is!","translation":"In a spacious mansion beautiful as a painting, women like dolls wearing small bracelets once pined, their jewels slipping, to approach this warrior. Now, having bathed in the waterfall of the tall mountain where bamboos grow, he kindles a hot red fire with firewood brought by forest elephants, and dries his twisted, matted hair that hangs down his back!","modern":"ஓவியம் போன்ற விசாலமான மாளிகையில், பொம்மை போன்ற சிறிய வளையல்களை அணிந்த பெண்கள், இந்த வீரனை நெருங்குவதற்காகத் தங்கள் ஆபரணங்கள் நெகிழ்ந்துபோகும் அளவுக்கு ஏங்கினார்கள். அத்தகைய வீரன், இன்று மூங்கில்கள் நிறைந்த உயர்ந்த மலையின் அருவியில் நீராடிவிட்டு, காட்டு யானைகள் கொண்டுவந்து தந்த விறகுகளைக் கொண்டு கடுமையான வெப்பமுடைய செந்தீயை மூட்டி, தன் முதுகில் தொங்கும் முறுக்கிய சடைமுடியைப் புலர்த்திக் கொண்டிருக்கிறான்!","explanation":"In this poem, the poet Māṟpittiyār observes a former great warrior who has now renounced his worldly life to become an ascetic. The poet contrasts the warrior's glorious past with his present simple life of penance. In the past, beautiful doll-like women in a spacious, painting-like mansion yearned for him so much that their ornaments slipped from their thinning bodies. Now, he bathes in mountain waterfalls and dries his long, matted hair over a fire kindled with wood brought by wild forest elephants. This stark contrast highlights the theme of Tāpata Vākai, celebrating the victory of spiritual renunciation over worldly pleasures. The imagery of wild elephants serving him shows how nature itself honors his ascetic power.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.9],[1.9,2.4],[2.4,2.7],[2.7,2.8],[2.8,3.8],[3.8,4.6],[4.6,4.9],[4.9,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.5],[6.5,6.5],[6.5,7.7],[7.7,7.7],[7.7,8.8],[8.8,9.1],[9.1,9.2],[9.2,10.3],[10.3,10.5],[10.5,11.0],[11.0,11.43],[11.43,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.97,13.17]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,2.8],[2.8,3.2],[3.2,3.2],[3.2,4.2],[4.2,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.3],[6.3,6.8],[6.8,7.53],[7.53,7.53],[7.53,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,10.6],[10.6,12.2],[12.2,12.4],[12.4,12.9],[12.9,14.1],[14.1,14.7],[14.7,14.85],[14.85,15.3]]},"sync":[[["ஓவத்து","of a painting"]],[["ஓவத்து","of a painting"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["இடனுடை","spacious"]],[["வரைப்பின்","of the mansion"]],[["பாவை","doll"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["குறுந்தொடி","small-braceleted"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["இழைநிலை","jewels' position"]],[["நெகிழ்ந்த","loosened"]],[["மள்ளற்கு","to the warrior"]],[["மள்ளற்கு","to the warrior"],["அண்டிக்கும்","approaching"]],[["கழைக்கண்","bamboo-joint"]],[["நெடுவரை","tall mountain"]],[["அருவியாடி","having bathed in the waterfall"]],[["கான","forest"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["தந்த","brought"]],[["விறகின்","with firewood"]],[["கடுந்தெறல்","intense heat"]],[["செந்தீ","red fire"]],[["வேட்டு","having kindled"]],[["புறம்தாழ்","hanging down the back"]],[["புரிசடை","twisted matted hair"]],[["புலர்த்துவோனே","he who dries!"]],[["புலர்த்துவோனே","he who dries!"]]]}